==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|ребёнокъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|ru|h₃erbʰ}}
From {{inh|ru|orv|робя}}, diminitive of {{m|orv|робъ||slave}} from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*orbę}}. Compare with {{m|ru|па́робок||lad}} {{i|dialectal}}. The relationship with "slave" could arise from the meaning "orphan" because orphans carried out the hard work in the household.

