====Usage notes====
* The singular form can only refer to "child"/"baby" sense.
* The plural form {{m|ru|ребя́та}} can mean "guys", "friends", etc.
* For the plural form "children" {{m|ru|де́ти}} is the preferred word but {{m|ru|ребя́та}} is also used.
* The suppletive plural form {{m|ru|де́ти}} is originally a plural form of {{m|ru|дитя́}}.

